WEBVTT

01:30.340 --> 01:33.578
=Against The Current=

01:33.579 --> 01:35.000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

01:35.180 --> 01:36.920
=Episode 5=
(This drama does not correspond)

01:36.930 --> 01:38.200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

01:38.210 --> 01:41.110
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

01:41.368 --> 01:42.950
As long as Young Master is pleased,

01:43.959 --> 01:45.959
surely she wouldn't
dare offend First Madam

01:46.079 --> 01:47.079
and Young Master.

01:53.760 --> 01:54.799
I heard

01:55.400 --> 01:57.480
Young Madam Liu on Taiping Street

01:57.599 --> 01:59.000
had a maid beaten to death.

02:00.200 --> 02:02.040
The authorities
arrested Young Madam Liu

02:02.959 --> 02:05.040
because the law says

02:05.599 --> 02:07.959
masters cannot kill
their servants without due cause.

02:08.240 --> 02:11.039
She was sentenced to one year in prison.

02:15.840 --> 02:17.560
What did the maid do wrong?

02:18.919 --> 02:22.039
They say Young Master Liu
took a liking to her.

02:22.479 --> 02:24.360
Young Madam Liu has quite a temper.

02:24.479 --> 02:26.599
In a fit of rage,
she ordered her servants

02:26.680 --> 02:29.080
to beat the maid to death.

02:38.312 --> 02:39.960
Do you just hate to see me doing well?

02:39.960 --> 02:41.890
Why else would you say
such things to curse me?

02:42.120 --> 02:44.590
I think you're just jealous
that Young Master rewarded me.

02:55.120 --> 02:56.439
You have to stay alive first

02:58.680 --> 03:00.439
before you
have a chance at a better life.

03:04.199 --> 03:06.439
Have you been busy at the barracks?

03:07.039 --> 03:09.560
I hardly see you all day.

03:10.879 --> 03:12.039
I've been away for many years.

03:12.120 --> 03:12.960
Now that I'm back,

03:12.970 --> 03:15.110
there are inevitably
social obligations to attend to.

03:15.120 --> 03:16.360
Don't drink too much.

03:16.719 --> 03:17.879
Take care of yourself.

03:18.000 --> 03:18.479
All right.

03:27.120 --> 03:28.599
I've obtained something important

03:29.199 --> 03:30.120
and wanted to ask you

03:30.920 --> 03:32.296
what you think I should do.

03:44.800 --> 03:45.800
These complaints

03:46.639 --> 03:49.199
were filed
by victims accusing Young Madam

03:49.439 --> 03:50.360
of making usurious loans

03:50.919 --> 03:54.000
that drove them to ruin
and tore their families apart.

03:55.740 --> 03:56.820
(Defendant: Madam Zhao)

04:02.680 --> 04:04.552
(Defendant: Madam Zhao.
Witness: Chang Asan)

04:16.680 --> 04:17.600
The Zhao family

04:18.168 --> 04:20.890
only rose to prominence after
Old Master Zhao entered officialdom.

04:20.920 --> 04:23.160
They believe a woman's
virtue lies in having no talent,

04:23.800 --> 04:26.040
so they refuse
to teach their women to read or write.

04:27.839 --> 04:30.560
Zhao Xingtang may be a great beauty,

04:30.639 --> 04:31.879
but she can't read a word.

04:32.519 --> 04:35.000
And yet she resorted
to such disgraceful dealings.

04:37.399 --> 04:39.920
When your father
insisted on this marriage,

04:40.240 --> 04:41.519
I knew it was unsuitable.

04:41.528 --> 04:42.920
Our families have different values.

04:42.952 --> 04:44.440
How could we ever be a good match?

04:45.279 --> 04:47.680
But your father
said the Zhao family's eldest daughter

04:47.759 --> 04:50.120
was Old Master Zhao's
favorite granddaughter,

04:50.264 --> 04:52.856
and Old Master Zhao
was a trusted confidant of His Majesty.

04:53.000 --> 04:54.870
For the Zhao family
to agree to this marriage

04:54.920 --> 04:56.680
was a blessing beyond measure for you.

04:57.319 --> 04:58.920
My poor son...

05:00.160 --> 05:01.639
I...

05:02.879 --> 05:03.560
I...

05:06.360 --> 05:07.079
Mother.

05:08.488 --> 05:09.870
Father isn't entirely to blame.

05:11.199 --> 05:12.439
Back then, Grandfather

05:13.600 --> 05:14.920
also approved of the marriage.

05:23.639 --> 05:25.720
What do you plan to do about this?

05:26.560 --> 05:27.600
With Judge Zhou's help,

05:28.072 --> 05:30.168
the victims
have all agreed to settle privately.

05:30.199 --> 05:32.720
I only brought
these complaints for you to see

05:32.904 --> 05:34.600
so you'd know what has been happening.

05:46.120 --> 05:47.399
And what exactly

05:48.040 --> 05:49.000
do you want me to know?

05:52.639 --> 05:55.160
I remember Zhao Xingtang's dowry

05:55.360 --> 05:58.040
was only 3,000 taels of silver.

05:58.800 --> 06:00.839
But judging
from the evidence we've found so far,

06:01.399 --> 06:04.240
her usurious loans
amounted to far more than that.

06:06.240 --> 06:09.000
Do you have proof that Zhao Xingtang

06:09.496 --> 06:11.240
used family funds to make those loans?

06:12.800 --> 06:15.600
Huang Youzhi,
the head shopkeeper of Rongbao Pavilion,

06:16.079 --> 06:18.319
and Liu Dacheng,
the head shopkeeper of the rice shop.

06:18.904 --> 06:19.950
There should be others,

06:21.319 --> 06:23.959
but I wasn't sure
what you wanted me to do.

06:24.152 --> 06:25.750
I was afraid of alerting Zhao Xingtang,

06:25.896 --> 06:27.510
so I didn't investigate any further.

06:29.439 --> 06:30.560
Those shopkeepers

06:30.639 --> 06:31.879
can be dealt with later.

06:33.240 --> 06:34.720
What matters most right now

06:35.120 --> 06:36.560
is making Zhao Xingtang stop.

06:38.120 --> 06:40.279
If Young Madam
of the Lin family loses face,

06:41.040 --> 06:42.800
then you lose face as well.

06:43.839 --> 06:45.319
If the Lin family loses face,

06:47.120 --> 06:49.000
we can't let this matter get any bigger.

06:52.879 --> 06:54.000
You're right, Mother.

06:57.112 --> 06:58.560
As for matters within the household,

06:59.160 --> 07:00.560
you should stay out of them.

07:01.040 --> 07:03.800
It will keep this
from affecting your marriage.

07:06.920 --> 07:07.480
All right.

07:25.279 --> 07:26.560
Do you know what this is about?

07:35.199 --> 07:36.360
Is everyone here?

07:37.600 --> 07:38.399
Yes.

07:39.319 --> 07:40.920
Since everyone is here,

07:41.920 --> 07:43.800
I'll announce some good news.

07:48.340 --> 07:51.199
(Wu Suan'er, Madam Qin's housekeeper)

07:51.199 --> 07:52.759
Congratulations, Qingxiang.

07:52.959 --> 07:54.720
Congratulations, Qingxiang.

07:55.800 --> 07:57.656
Yesterday, Second Butler Yang
from the capital

07:57.660 --> 07:59.016
returned to Jinling with a message.

07:59.160 --> 08:01.319
First Madam found him capable

08:01.319 --> 08:02.560
and trustworthy.

08:03.319 --> 08:04.399
She thought of Qingxiang,

08:04.399 --> 08:07.079
who has served Young Madam faithfully
all these years.

08:07.800 --> 08:09.360
You're already twenty-two

08:09.839 --> 08:11.399
and still unmarried.

08:12.079 --> 08:14.160
So she agreed
to Second Butler Yang's request

08:14.759 --> 08:17.120
and betrothed Qingxiang to him.

08:17.759 --> 08:19.560
When Second Butler Yang leaves later,

08:19.920 --> 08:21.839
Qingxiang will board the boat with him.

08:21.920 --> 08:25.160
They'll marry as soon
as they reach the capital.

08:26.879 --> 08:28.480
Qingxiang is my maid.

08:29.759 --> 08:31.040
You wretched old woman.

08:31.680 --> 08:34.159
How dare you do something so vile?

08:34.200 --> 08:35.720
Who doesn't know Second Butler Yang

08:35.752 --> 08:37.160
is already well into his forties,

08:37.240 --> 08:38.910
a widower whose wife is dead?

08:39.360 --> 08:40.399
Our Qingxiang

08:40.480 --> 08:42.200
is a fine unmarried young lady.

08:42.279 --> 08:43.840
Why should she marry some old man?

08:45.080 --> 08:46.039
Are you

08:46.600 --> 08:48.240
saying I've lost my judgment?

08:56.480 --> 08:57.279
I wouldn't dare.

09:00.000 --> 09:02.039
Qingxiang has been
by my side since she was little.

09:02.679 --> 09:05.960
I could never bear
to see her marry so far away.

09:06.919 --> 09:08.600
She's not marrying
into some other family.

09:08.680 --> 09:10.712
She'll still be part
of the Lin household.

09:10.919 --> 09:13.399
You can see her whenever you wish.

09:14.799 --> 09:18.080
Or do you look down on our Lin family?

09:18.919 --> 09:19.879
I wouldn't dare.

09:21.200 --> 09:22.000
It's just...

09:23.639 --> 09:27.320
Qingxiang's indenture
is still with the Zhao family.

09:28.120 --> 09:29.320
That's a small matter.

09:29.679 --> 09:32.000
Send someone to speak with your mother

09:32.159 --> 09:33.600
and ask her for the indenture.

09:33.879 --> 09:34.320
Yes.

09:36.639 --> 09:39.559
No matter how much we say,
it's all pointless

09:40.320 --> 09:41.240
unless

09:41.840 --> 09:44.159
we ask Qingxiang whether
she herself is willing to marry.

09:44.960 --> 09:46.759
All right.

09:47.180 --> 09:48.660
No.

09:49.000 --> 09:49.360
I...

09:49.399 --> 09:50.320
Qingxiang.

09:54.279 --> 09:56.320
This is the dowry
First Madam prepared for you.

09:58.399 --> 10:00.120
Take a good look.

10:00.220 --> 10:01.519
(Defendant: Madam Zhao.
Witness: Chang Asan)

10:01.519 --> 10:03.159
Tell your Young Madam

10:04.559 --> 10:05.720
whether you're willing

10:05.919 --> 10:07.080
or not.

10:15.200 --> 10:17.000
I... I'm willing.

10:18.600 --> 10:19.559
Qingxiang.

10:19.720 --> 10:20.639
My Lady.

10:22.080 --> 10:23.080
I'm willing.

10:23.840 --> 10:24.720
Qingxiang.

10:24.919 --> 10:26.080
I'm willing.

10:34.960 --> 10:36.440
Since Qingxiang has agreed,

10:36.519 --> 10:37.600
- Madam.
- then...

10:46.559 --> 10:47.200
Madam.

10:48.679 --> 10:49.399
Madam.

10:50.039 --> 10:52.279
Qingxiang has been
with me since she was ten.

10:53.080 --> 10:54.080
All these years,

10:54.856 --> 10:56.872
we may have
been mistress and servant in name,

10:57.864 --> 10:59.750
but in truth,
we've been as close as sisters.

11:04.039 --> 11:06.120
Madam, I beg you to show mercy.

11:09.159 --> 11:10.960
Please let Qingxiang stay with me.

11:12.840 --> 11:15.120
I know you can't bear
to part with Qingxiang,

11:15.519 --> 11:17.840
but everyone
must marry when the time comes.

11:18.240 --> 11:19.840
Qingxiang herself is willing,

11:20.159 --> 11:22.879
so we should grant her wish.

11:23.200 --> 11:23.840
No, Madam.

11:23.879 --> 11:25.960
She doesn't want this.
Madam, I'm begging you.

11:26.120 --> 11:27.240
She doesn't want this.

11:27.879 --> 11:29.000
- Madam.
- Hurry.

11:29.240 --> 11:30.600
It's getting late.

11:31.039 --> 11:32.279
See Qingxiang out.

11:32.328 --> 11:33.510
Don't let her miss the boat.

11:34.159 --> 11:35.200
Qingxiang,

11:36.360 --> 11:37.159
this way, please.

11:37.320 --> 11:38.120
Qingxiang.

11:39.399 --> 11:40.120
Qingxiang.

11:41.080 --> 11:41.799
Qingxiang.

12:03.720 --> 12:04.480
Qingxiang.

12:52.100 --> 12:58.460
(Spring Breeze Carries the Seasons)

13:18.639 --> 13:19.799
Why is everyone so quiet?

13:22.919 --> 13:24.799
Qingxiang left so suddenly.

13:25.320 --> 13:26.799
Aren't you sad?

13:28.879 --> 13:30.320
She's not my real sister.

13:30.320 --> 13:31.840
Why would I be sad?

13:32.799 --> 13:33.600
Besides,

13:34.120 --> 13:35.080
now that she's gone,

13:37.559 --> 13:39.399
we should all be happy.

13:40.960 --> 13:42.840
A first-class maid's position is vacant.

13:42.850 --> 13:45.190
They'll promote someone
from the second-class maids, right?

13:45.640 --> 13:47.460
Then a second-class
position will be vacant,

13:47.480 --> 13:49.990
so someone from
the third-class maids will be promoted.

13:52.720 --> 13:54.320
We're not Young Madam's people.

13:54.480 --> 13:56.000
There's no chance we'll be promoted.

13:56.200 --> 13:58.056
We'll be lucky
if nothing bad happens to us.

13:58.559 --> 13:59.360
Bad luck?

14:00.559 --> 14:01.919
How so?

14:04.440 --> 14:06.440
Didn't you see Young Madam today?

14:06.504 --> 14:08.648
First Madam usually
leaves the household affairs alone

14:08.696 --> 14:09.592
and rarely says much.

14:10.200 --> 14:11.639
But once she speaks,

14:13.120 --> 14:15.120
Young Madam
has no choice but to obey.

14:15.759 --> 14:17.240
And we're First Madam's people.

14:19.159 --> 14:20.399
My mother always says,

14:20.919 --> 14:22.159
when the powerful clash,

14:22.480 --> 14:23.759
ordinary people suffer.

14:31.080 --> 14:32.960
Ji'er, Yingge, Xiaolian, and Lanxiang.

14:33.120 --> 14:34.279
Young Madam wants to see you.

14:35.960 --> 14:36.679
Coming.

14:44.200 --> 14:45.039
Go on.

14:47.159 --> 14:47.960
Eat it in secret.

14:48.200 --> 14:49.360
Don't let those two see.

14:51.360 --> 14:52.360
Young Madam is waiting.

14:52.399 --> 14:53.120
Hurry.

14:59.159 --> 15:00.639
Hurry, Lanxiang.

15:05.759 --> 15:06.879
You four

15:07.639 --> 15:10.600
were all carefully chosen
and sent here by First Madam.

15:11.279 --> 15:13.039
Even if you are First Madam's people,

15:13.120 --> 15:15.120
you must still follow
the rules of this household.

15:15.840 --> 15:16.919
The first rule

15:18.000 --> 15:19.919
is that you must not steal.

15:24.056 --> 15:25.630
Whichever one of you stole something,

15:26.399 --> 15:27.480
confess now,

15:29.159 --> 15:30.639
and I may show you some leniency.

15:31.440 --> 15:33.240
But if I catch you
with the stolen goods,

15:34.399 --> 15:35.879
don't blame me for showing no mercy.

15:40.159 --> 15:41.360
I didn't steal anything.

15:42.240 --> 15:43.399
I have no idea

15:44.312 --> 15:45.704
what the others may have done.

15:49.200 --> 15:49.919
Young Madam,

15:49.928 --> 15:51.200
I swear I didn't steal anything.

15:53.759 --> 15:54.559
Young Madam,

15:55.080 --> 15:56.320
I didn't steal anything either.

15:56.639 --> 15:58.919
And I never saw any of the other girls

15:58.919 --> 16:00.480
take anything they shouldn't have.

16:01.800 --> 16:03.080
I didn't steal anything either.

16:03.759 --> 16:04.919
If you don't believe me,

16:04.960 --> 16:06.480
you can search me right now.

16:42.159 --> 16:43.159
That's not mine.

16:43.519 --> 16:45.159
I've never seen that gold ring before.

16:46.440 --> 16:47.639
Young Madam!

16:47.679 --> 16:48.720
That's not mine.

16:49.080 --> 16:49.799
Young Madam!

16:50.080 --> 16:51.120
That's not mine!

16:51.440 --> 16:52.159
Young Madam.

16:52.440 --> 16:53.120
Young Madam.

16:53.440 --> 16:56.240
I gave that ring to Zijin.

16:56.919 --> 16:58.720
I never thought you'd steal it from her.

16:59.560 --> 17:01.240
You've been caught
with the stolen goods.

17:01.600 --> 17:02.279
No!

17:03.000 --> 17:04.119
Even First Madam

17:04.519 --> 17:05.319
would never tolerate

17:05.319 --> 17:07.319
a thieving servant like you.

17:10.079 --> 17:10.880
Tie her up.

17:10.960 --> 17:11.759
Young Madam!

17:12.039 --> 17:12.680
It's not mine.

17:12.720 --> 17:13.680
It really isn't mine!

17:13.720 --> 17:14.279
Stolen goods

17:14.279 --> 17:15.450
wouldn't be yours, of course.

17:18.359 --> 17:19.640
Get up there.

17:23.519 --> 17:26.039
Young Master sent someone
to the tearoom for tea,

17:26.880 --> 17:28.519
but you, a third-class maid,

17:28.720 --> 17:31.960
went to Sanjue Hall
to deliver it without permission.

17:32.400 --> 17:34.640
Clearly, you've never
had any regard for the rules.

17:36.519 --> 17:37.359
These past two days,

17:37.720 --> 17:39.759
you asked
the servant guarding the side gate

17:39.839 --> 17:42.559
to buy you pine nut candy
and fashionable silk flowers.

17:43.440 --> 17:45.480
You even sent one tael of silver home.

17:46.759 --> 17:47.599
Clearly,

17:47.880 --> 17:49.759
you're not the only thief.

17:50.079 --> 17:53.079
Your whole family is a pack of thieves.

17:54.000 --> 17:55.839
Young Master gave me that silver.

17:56.240 --> 17:58.319
Who would believe
you got two taels of silver

17:58.319 --> 17:59.960
just for delivering two jars of tea?

18:00.799 --> 18:02.440
Zijin has delivered tea
plenty of times,

18:02.599 --> 18:04.799
and she's never come back
with so much as half a tael.

18:05.079 --> 18:07.440
Are you saying
you're more capable than Zijin?

18:10.920 --> 18:12.359
Young Master really gave it to me.

18:12.799 --> 18:14.359
He can vouch for me.

18:14.616 --> 18:16.240
Young Master has gone
to the Garrison.

18:17.119 --> 18:18.119
Do you really think

18:18.559 --> 18:20.480
he'd abandon
his official duties and rush back

18:20.519 --> 18:22.319
for a worthless servant like you?

18:23.079 --> 18:26.160
Even if Young Master
did give you that silver,

18:26.240 --> 18:27.319
what about this ring?

18:27.799 --> 18:29.359
Did Young Master give you that, too?

18:31.240 --> 18:32.880
That ring isn't mine.

18:33.720 --> 18:34.904
That ring isn't mine.

18:34.920 --> 18:36.740
Young Madam,
don't waste your breath on her.

18:36.759 --> 18:38.079
A greedy,

18:38.160 --> 18:39.720
dishonest servant like her

18:39.720 --> 18:41.079
should be beaten to death.

18:43.559 --> 18:44.279
Beat her!

18:44.519 --> 18:45.319
Young Madam!

18:49.519 --> 18:50.319
Young Madam!

18:54.079 --> 18:54.839
Young Madam!

18:55.440 --> 18:57.279
I've never seen that ring before.

18:58.400 --> 19:01.440
I've truly never seen
that gold ring before!

19:01.440 --> 19:02.960
I didn't steal it!

19:03.279 --> 19:05.319
I didn't steal it!

19:07.640 --> 19:08.480
I didn't steal it.

19:18.279 --> 19:20.240
I didn't steal it...

19:24.319 --> 19:26.920
I didn't steal it...

19:28.880 --> 19:31.480
I didn't steal it...

19:55.680 --> 19:56.319
Young Madam!

19:56.480 --> 19:57.279
It was my fault.

19:57.720 --> 19:58.839
I didn't mean to do it.

19:59.016 --> 20:00.952
Young Madam,
please don't beat me to death.

20:01.070 --> 20:02.952
Young Madam,
please don't beat me to death.

20:06.160 --> 20:07.119
I didn't mean to do it.

20:07.224 --> 20:09.110
Please, Young Madam,
don't beat me to death.

20:09.160 --> 20:09.839
Please don't!

20:09.839 --> 20:11.680
(Young Madam Liu of Taiping Street)

20:11.759 --> 20:13.000
(had a maid beaten to death.)

20:13.240 --> 20:15.079
(Young Madam Liu of Taiping Street)

20:15.279 --> 20:16.519
(had a maid beaten to death.)

20:17.000 --> 20:18.799
(The authorities
arrested Young Madam Liu.)

20:19.640 --> 20:21.920
(They said that under the law.)

20:28.240 --> 20:29.240
(I heard)

20:30.079 --> 20:31.839
(Young Madam Liu of Taiping Street)

20:32.079 --> 20:33.319
(had a maid beaten to death.)

20:33.839 --> 20:35.640
(The authorities
arrested Young Madam Liu.)

20:35.960 --> 20:40.000
- They said that under the law,
- (They said that under the law...)

20:40.152 --> 20:45.750
masters cannot kill
their servants without due cause...

20:47.119 --> 20:51.680
Young Madam Liu
was sentenced to one year in prison.

20:53.839 --> 20:55.960
One year in prison...

21:03.359 --> 21:04.480
Did that really happen?

21:06.359 --> 21:07.920
I believe it did.

21:22.920 --> 21:24.359
You may escape death,

21:24.960 --> 21:26.359
but you won't escape punishment.

21:48.680 --> 21:51.680
Lv Ji'er conspired with her family

21:51.799 --> 21:53.720
to steal Young Madam's belongings.

21:54.240 --> 21:55.519
Young Madam has ordered

21:56.119 --> 21:59.240
the entire family
to be taken away and sold.

22:00.400 --> 22:01.720
No!

22:02.640 --> 22:03.839
No!

22:06.519 --> 22:07.440
Young Madam, have mercy!

22:07.450 --> 22:08.430
Young Madam, have mercy!

22:08.440 --> 22:09.112
Please, no!

22:09.144 --> 22:09.830
Please spare us!

22:09.839 --> 22:12.000
Don't sell the whole family
to the same household.

22:12.359 --> 22:13.400
Otherwise,

22:13.799 --> 22:16.160
they may join forces
and cause trouble for another family.

22:17.359 --> 22:18.240
We were wrong!

22:18.400 --> 22:19.559
We truly were!

22:19.680 --> 22:20.880
- Have mercy!
- Move!

22:21.680 --> 22:22.279
Move!

22:25.599 --> 22:26.200
Move!

22:29.900 --> 22:32.140
Father!

22:32.780 --> 22:35.020
- Move!
- Father!

22:36.420 --> 22:37.860
Move!

22:38.380 --> 22:39.740
- Move!
- Move!

23:14.799 --> 23:16.599
This is what happens

23:16.632 --> 23:19.144
to those with wicked intentions
who betray their masters.

23:19.680 --> 23:21.079
Young Madam ordered

23:21.680 --> 23:23.480
you should all take a good look

23:23.480 --> 23:25.200
and remember this well.

23:26.720 --> 23:28.000
Have you seen clearly?

23:29.799 --> 23:30.839
Yes.

23:32.440 --> 23:33.839
- Yes.
- Yes.

23:47.119 --> 23:48.440
You are

23:49.200 --> 23:50.839
Lanxiang's parents?

23:57.599 --> 23:58.799
My father is Xu Wanquan.

23:59.119 --> 24:00.279
My mother is Xue Guihua.

24:00.519 --> 24:01.640
My name is Xu Lanxiang.

24:04.559 --> 24:06.799
Now that you're serving
in Young Madam's courtyard,

24:06.960 --> 24:09.240
you must follow her rules.

24:09.559 --> 24:10.359
Otherwise,

24:11.240 --> 24:13.079
you won't be the only one to suffer.

24:13.200 --> 24:14.880
Your parents will suffer as well.

24:17.400 --> 24:18.440
Do you understand?

24:20.359 --> 24:21.039
Yes.

24:23.799 --> 24:24.440
Go back.

24:35.119 --> 24:36.799
You in the back, keep up.

24:47.160 --> 24:48.720
Let's go. Come on, let's go.

25:52.519 --> 25:53.960
I was so absentminded.

25:54.799 --> 25:57.440
I'd been meaning to give her
the sachet I just embroidered.

25:57.680 --> 25:58.839
But when I saw her today,

25:59.440 --> 26:00.960
it completely slipped my mind.

26:01.592 --> 26:02.504
All right, enough.

26:04.480 --> 26:07.720
Young Madam was clearly
making an example of them.

26:07.880 --> 26:10.000
You can't go
and cause more trouble for Lanxiang.

26:12.008 --> 26:14.350
If I'd known life in the residence
would be this difficult,

26:16.920 --> 26:18.799
we might as well
have married her off early.

26:19.279 --> 26:21.759
You may be willing
to marry Lanxiang off to just anyone,

26:22.160 --> 26:23.440
but I'm not.

26:27.519 --> 26:29.160
Then what do we do now?

26:30.480 --> 26:31.599
Just sit around and wait?

26:32.599 --> 26:33.839
I've been thinking.

26:35.599 --> 26:36.880
We should put up some money

26:37.030 --> 26:38.888
and ask someone
to help make arrangements,

26:39.279 --> 26:41.839
so we can at least
exchange messages with her.

26:42.240 --> 26:43.720
Then hurry and do it.

26:44.000 --> 26:45.880
We can earn the money back slowly.

26:46.200 --> 26:47.799
As long as our child has a good life,

26:47.880 --> 26:50.279
I don't mind how hard I have to work.

26:50.720 --> 26:51.920
Then it's settled.

27:02.920 --> 27:05.599
Lv Ji'er and her family
have all been sent away.

27:06.000 --> 27:08.759
But they're servants of the Lin family.

27:09.240 --> 27:10.279
Their indentures...

27:12.200 --> 27:13.160
Indentures?

27:14.720 --> 27:16.559
Didn't First Madam say

27:18.200 --> 27:19.359
that for such a small matter,

27:19.759 --> 27:22.279
we only need
to send someone to inform her?

27:22.960 --> 27:24.039
But...

27:29.279 --> 27:30.160
What are you afraid of?

27:31.079 --> 27:33.440
If she can dispose
of a maid from my Zhao family,

27:34.039 --> 27:35.160
why can't I dispose of a few

27:35.160 --> 27:36.880
servants from the Lin family?

27:40.279 --> 27:41.079
My Lady.

27:41.440 --> 27:42.720
First Madam is here.

27:44.200 --> 27:46.160
It's First Madam of the Zhao family.

27:47.440 --> 27:48.240
Mother?

27:50.920 --> 27:51.640
First Madam.

28:00.119 --> 28:00.920
Mother.

28:04.759 --> 28:05.359
Mother.

28:05.720 --> 28:06.680
What brings you here?

28:06.920 --> 28:08.039
Is something the matter?

28:10.408 --> 28:12.230
(An Moli, Zhao Xingtang's Mother)
Listen to you.

28:12.240 --> 28:14.400
(First Madam of the Zhao Family)
Can't I visit you without a reason?

28:15.599 --> 28:17.200
I'm simply a mother

28:19.160 --> 28:20.240
who misses her daughter.

28:29.279 --> 28:31.519
Your hands are still cold.

28:31.839 --> 28:34.480
Why hasn't your uterine chill improved?

28:42.160 --> 28:43.839
Drinking tea alone won't help.

28:44.232 --> 28:45.960
You need to take your medicine properly.

28:46.640 --> 28:48.039
You're already twenty-three.

28:48.599 --> 28:51.240
You can't keep acting
willfully like a child.

28:53.400 --> 28:54.319
You know very well

28:54.319 --> 28:56.559
why I developed this uterine chill.

28:58.039 --> 29:00.519
You married me into the Lin family

29:00.520 --> 29:02.152
without caring whether I lived or died.

29:02.559 --> 29:04.359
Why say all this now?

29:14.200 --> 29:15.000
Go on.

29:16.839 --> 29:17.880
What did you come here for?

29:21.960 --> 29:23.279
Your father said

29:24.519 --> 29:28.359
your husband hasn't visited us
once since he returned.

29:28.920 --> 29:30.960
He's worried
the two of you are at odds again,

29:32.200 --> 29:33.759
so he asked me to come and see you.

29:36.000 --> 29:37.400
He told me to remind you

29:38.079 --> 29:39.480
to rein in your temper

29:40.079 --> 29:42.640
and not damage
your relationship with your husband.

29:44.039 --> 29:45.160
Your father also said

29:45.640 --> 29:48.000
Old Master
favors our branch of the family

29:48.712 --> 29:50.960
not because of that
good-for-nothing brother of yours,

29:52.200 --> 29:53.319
but because of your husband.

29:54.000 --> 29:55.480
You may not have had an education,

29:55.864 --> 29:57.480
but you certainly know
what the books say

29:57.592 --> 29:59.270
about a husband
being a wife's whole world

29:59.359 --> 30:00.720
better than anyone.

30:01.480 --> 30:03.279
You follow it far better

30:03.759 --> 30:05.079
than my well-read mother-in-law.

30:11.359 --> 30:12.519
Isn't that simply

30:13.319 --> 30:15.559
the fate of women like us?

30:17.720 --> 30:19.200
What if I refuse to accept that fate?

30:23.359 --> 30:24.440
Your father said so,

30:25.160 --> 30:26.559
and I feel the same way.

30:27.279 --> 30:29.359
You should
have a child as soon as possible.

30:29.640 --> 30:31.559
Only then can you
keep your husband's heart.

30:32.039 --> 30:33.119
I can't have children.

30:34.440 --> 30:36.039
Then choose a pretty maid.

30:36.200 --> 30:38.599
Once she gives birth,
send her far away.

30:38.680 --> 30:40.119
Raise the child by your side,

30:40.359 --> 30:41.440
and the child will be yours.

30:41.440 --> 30:43.288
- It's getting late!
- Just like your own.

30:48.440 --> 30:49.519
If there's nothing else,

30:51.200 --> 30:52.359
you should hurry home.

31:07.680 --> 31:09.000
Everything your parents do

31:09.000 --> 31:10.079
is for your own good.

31:11.119 --> 31:12.599
You need to listen to us

31:13.599 --> 31:14.480
and do as we say.

31:39.440 --> 31:40.440
My Lady.

31:44.200 --> 31:45.079
Make preparations.

31:46.216 --> 31:47.830
We're going to Jinxiu House tomorrow.

31:49.000 --> 31:50.160
My Lady.

31:50.720 --> 31:51.680
In this world,

31:54.759 --> 31:56.240
not all parents

31:56.792 --> 31:58.550
consider what's best
for their daughters.

32:03.279 --> 32:04.759
I can only rely on myself.

32:15.700 --> 32:18.260
(Jinxiu House)

32:41.220 --> 32:45.460
(Qian Shaoze, Zhao Xingtang's Cousin)

32:45.759 --> 32:47.079
Why are 600 taels missing?

32:48.536 --> 32:49.680
The accounts are correct.

32:50.799 --> 32:53.079
I had 600 taels sent to Qingxiang.

32:53.790 --> 32:55.208
It's her first time in the capital.

32:55.590 --> 32:56.856
She doesn't know anyone there.

32:57.799 --> 32:59.200
Having some money on hand

32:59.759 --> 33:01.079
will make things easier for her.

33:03.119 --> 33:04.279
With 600 taels,

33:05.160 --> 33:07.030
you could buy
plenty of maids like Qingxiang.

33:09.359 --> 33:12.839
Do you think a maid
who can read and keep accounts

33:13.160 --> 33:14.960
is so easy to find?

33:17.240 --> 33:19.000
But didn't you

33:19.240 --> 33:20.759
buy Qingxiang for ten taels back then?

33:24.680 --> 33:25.720
Even if I were lucky enough

33:25.768 --> 33:27.830
to find another maid
who can read and keep accounts,

33:28.200 --> 33:29.640
could she be like Qingxiang,

33:30.079 --> 33:31.680
who grew up with me

33:31.752 --> 33:33.672
and has always been utterly loyal to me?

33:34.519 --> 33:36.240
There can never be another Qingxiang.

33:41.319 --> 33:42.440
I was wrong.

33:42.680 --> 33:44.160
Six hundred taels it is.

33:45.119 --> 33:47.119
We'll just earn it back later.

33:55.240 --> 33:57.000
Zijin is no help at all.

33:59.359 --> 34:02.200
What am I going to do
about the accounts from now on?

34:06.200 --> 34:07.416
Let me show you something.

34:20.079 --> 34:21.159
Six years ago,

34:21.800 --> 34:24.079
I had this pair
of mandarin duck seals carved

34:24.080 --> 34:25.576
from the tianhuang stone in my dowry.

34:25.880 --> 34:28.599
I gave you the raised-carving duck seal,

34:28.960 --> 34:31.719
and kept
the recessed-carving mate for myself.

34:42.159 --> 34:45.119
From now on,
I'll calculate the accounts and money

34:46.000 --> 34:47.440
that Zijin brings back for you.

34:47.840 --> 34:49.679
(Gold)
You only need to look for this seal.

34:53.760 --> 34:54.880
Whenever I receive them,

34:55.519 --> 34:56.920
I'll stamp them with my own seal.

34:57.672 --> 34:59.672
Then you'll know
I've received the money?

35:03.480 --> 35:04.679
You're the clever one.

35:07.016 --> 35:08.824
I thought it would be a few more years

35:08.888 --> 35:10.590
before we'd have
any use for these seals.

35:11.360 --> 35:13.400
I didn't expect
they'd come in handy so soon.

35:19.576 --> 35:20.952
Just hold on a little longer.

35:21.224 --> 35:22.712
Once we've saved enough money,

35:23.400 --> 35:24.840
we can leave the Lin family.

35:48.780 --> 35:53.960
(Spring Breeze Carries the Seasons)

35:54.056 --> 35:55.480
How long has First Madam been here?

35:55.519 --> 35:56.679
About 15 minutes.

35:57.000 --> 35:58.079
I said I'd send you to her

35:58.079 --> 35:59.239
as soon as you returned,

35:59.400 --> 36:01.519
but First Madam
said there was no hurry.

36:01.520 --> 36:03.944
She had nothing else to do,
so she'd have some tea and wait.

36:04.199 --> 36:04.920
Nanny, do you know

36:05.000 --> 36:06.239
why First Madam is here?

36:06.239 --> 36:07.639
Stop looking so miserable.

36:07.840 --> 36:09.119
If it's not because I went out,

36:09.239 --> 36:10.960
it must be because I took it upon myself

36:10.960 --> 36:12.376
to dispose of Ji'er and her family.

36:12.400 --> 36:13.559
That's exactly why.

36:18.960 --> 36:20.679
Go fetch Xiaolian and Lanxiang.

36:20.728 --> 36:22.472
Have them
wait outside the hall for orders.

36:23.960 --> 36:24.679
Hurry up.

36:24.800 --> 36:25.280
Yes.

36:43.559 --> 36:44.239
Madam.

36:46.840 --> 36:48.920
The silk shop received a new shipment,

36:49.239 --> 36:50.480
so I went to have a look.

36:50.679 --> 36:52.079
I'm sorry to have kept you waiting.

36:52.199 --> 36:53.599
It was my fault.

36:56.840 --> 36:59.880
Our Lin family has never forbidden
our daughters-in-law from going out.

37:00.760 --> 37:03.360
But from now on,
take a few more maids with you.

37:04.039 --> 37:05.280
With only Zijin by your side,

37:05.760 --> 37:06.888
those who don't know better

37:06.890 --> 37:08.920
might think
the Lin family mistreats you.

37:10.800 --> 37:11.960
You're right, Madam.

37:12.320 --> 37:13.480
I'll remember that.

37:18.480 --> 37:21.960
Lv Er and his family
were caught stealing.

37:22.960 --> 37:25.599
Since you've already
sent them away, so be it.

37:26.679 --> 37:28.400
I really had no other choice.

37:29.119 --> 37:31.440
People like that can't be kept on.

37:33.256 --> 37:35.030
I've managed
this household for many years.

37:36.079 --> 37:37.760
Lv Er and his family
always did their duty

37:37.840 --> 37:39.079
and never caused any trouble.

37:40.136 --> 37:41.944
Yet that changed under your management.

37:46.519 --> 37:48.400
Servants are like mules and horses.

37:48.792 --> 37:50.920
Manage them well,
and they'll be docile and obedient.

37:50.968 --> 37:53.512
Manage them poorly, and they'll
become unruly and hard to handle.

37:54.320 --> 37:55.239
You

37:55.400 --> 37:56.800
are still too young.

37:58.680 --> 37:59.800
I'm partly to blame as well.

38:00.424 --> 38:02.376
I've taken things easy
these past few years

38:02.599 --> 38:04.039
and left this entire household

38:04.039 --> 38:05.880
for you to manage on your own.

38:06.199 --> 38:07.280
I think

38:07.760 --> 38:10.119
I'll take back
the household authority tokens for now

38:10.472 --> 38:12.584
and shoulder
the burden for a few more years.

38:25.440 --> 38:28.320
Madam Feng, please bring me the tokens.

38:36.000 --> 38:36.719
Madam.

38:37.159 --> 38:38.599
I'm young and inexperienced.

38:38.800 --> 38:39.920
If I've done anything poorly,

38:40.119 --> 38:41.119
please teach me,

38:41.150 --> 38:42.376
and I promise I'll correct it.

38:43.016 --> 38:45.160
If you take back
the household authority tokens,

38:45.559 --> 38:46.519
how can I

38:47.719 --> 38:48.840
face anyone after this?

38:50.559 --> 38:51.599
Look at you.

38:52.199 --> 38:54.159
I'm doing this for your own good.

38:54.920 --> 38:56.719
This will give you time to rest

38:56.840 --> 38:58.480
and restore your health.

38:59.280 --> 39:00.760
Jinqi is the eldest grandson.

39:01.280 --> 39:02.679
Old Master and Old Madam

39:02.800 --> 39:05.480
are both eagerly
awaiting a great-grandson.

39:11.840 --> 39:12.480
Madam.

39:13.760 --> 39:15.159
Yesterday, my mother

39:15.920 --> 39:17.599
also spoke to me about having a child.

39:18.320 --> 39:20.320
She said Grandfather had written

39:20.400 --> 39:22.200
and mentioned
the matter of an heir as well.

39:22.400 --> 39:23.760
I thought about it all night.

39:24.239 --> 39:25.239
Early this morning,

39:25.559 --> 39:27.480
I went to the shop
and bought some new silk

39:28.239 --> 39:30.199
to give to Xiaolian and Lanxiang.

39:36.960 --> 39:38.480
Xiaolian, Lanxiang.

39:38.960 --> 39:39.960
Come in.

39:51.064 --> 39:52.328
- First Madam.
- First Madam.

39:57.000 --> 39:58.239
From today onward,

39:59.039 --> 40:00.119
the two of them

40:00.400 --> 40:02.400
will be second-class maids

40:03.599 --> 40:05.159
and serve by my side.

40:09.679 --> 40:10.880
These two pieces of silk...

40:11.280 --> 40:12.840
One is for Xiaolian,

40:13.679 --> 40:15.599
and the other is for Lanxiang.

40:16.079 --> 40:17.480
Take their measurements

40:17.840 --> 40:19.119
and make each of them an outfit.

40:19.599 --> 40:21.280
Dress them nicely.

40:21.599 --> 40:23.199
If Young Master is pleased,

40:23.440 --> 40:24.679
I'll be pleased, too.

40:34.280 --> 40:35.079
Madam.

40:36.599 --> 40:39.000
Are you pleased with the fabric I chose?

40:40.480 --> 40:41.639
I've always trusted

40:42.199 --> 40:43.599
your taste.

40:47.480 --> 40:49.039
I'm glad you're pleased, Madam.

40:50.599 --> 40:54.199
Thank you, First Madam
and Young Madam.

40:54.760 --> 40:56.320
You just got back.

40:56.800 --> 40:57.840
You must be tired.

40:57.880 --> 40:59.039
Get some rest.

40:59.119 --> 41:00.400
I won't stay any longer.

41:01.679 --> 41:02.280
Yes.

41:17.840 --> 41:18.960
Take care, Madam.

41:36.472 --> 41:39.112
Make the arrangements
for these two as I just instructed.

41:39.960 --> 41:40.559
Yes.

41:44.792 --> 41:46.480
Now that you're
second-class maids, you'll

41:46.480 --> 41:48.216
share a room
with just one other person.

41:48.248 --> 41:50.030
But Young Madam
hasn't promoted anyone

41:50.239 --> 41:51.880
to fill Qingxiang's position yet,

41:51.960 --> 41:53.630
so there aren't
any vacant rooms for now.

41:54.230 --> 41:56.056
This room happens
to be one person short,

41:56.199 --> 41:57.920
and Yingge is quiet,

41:58.119 --> 42:00.920
so I'm afraid
you'll have to make do here for now.

42:01.760 --> 42:03.440
I'm used to living here.

42:03.559 --> 42:04.599
I'd rather not move.

42:05.440 --> 42:06.320
Me too.

42:11.119 --> 42:13.840
If either of you
catches Young Master's eye,

42:14.239 --> 42:16.840
you may soon have a room of your own.

42:17.679 --> 42:21.400
Then you'll have whatever you want.

42:26.239 --> 42:28.559
You have half the day off today.

42:29.039 --> 42:30.199
The tailor will come by later

42:30.199 --> 42:31.400
to take your measurements.

42:31.800 --> 42:32.760
Tomorrow morning,

42:32.880 --> 42:34.800
report to Young Madam
for instructions.

43:04.980 --> 43:07.420
=Against the Current=
(Next Episode's Preview)

43:08.719 --> 43:11.119
Do you want to know
what happened afterward?

43:14.079 --> 43:15.039
What happened?

43:16.079 --> 43:17.639
When I saw the storyteller out,

43:17.840 --> 43:19.320
she told me everything.

43:19.400 --> 43:21.496
Later, Second Master Yang killed
the adulterous pair

43:21.500 --> 43:22.550
with a single stroke.

43:22.880 --> 43:24.440
Then, fearing the scandal would spread

43:24.559 --> 43:25.519
and disgrace his family,

43:25.880 --> 43:29.679
he killed several of the older maids
and young maids in the household, too.

43:33.039 --> 43:33.519
Yang...

43:54.140 --> 43:58.260
♪Spring slips from the
branches once more♪

44:01.100 --> 44:05.620
♪Flowers bloom unseen,
as they have before♪

44:06.900 --> 44:10.820
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

44:11.500 --> 44:14.260
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

44:14.980 --> 44:17.300
♪Though all the world may fade♪

44:17.300 --> 44:20.380
♪Time rolls on as
countless lives rush by♪

44:21.900 --> 44:26.140
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

44:29.060 --> 44:33.220
♪No page could hold the
longing words can never show♪

44:35.020 --> 44:38.580
♪Every joy and sorrow
in this fleeting life♪

44:38.580 --> 44:42.140
♪Fades into the past
as new wounds rise♪

44:42.940 --> 44:48.620
♪While whispers of perfume
linger beneath the eaves♪

44:48.980 --> 44:53.300
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

44:53.660 --> 44:56.620
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

44:56.620 --> 45:00.380
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

45:00.380 --> 45:03.260
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

45:03.260 --> 45:07.340
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

45:07.340 --> 45:10.700
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

45:10.700 --> 45:14.460
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

45:14.460 --> 45:18.460
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

45:19.220 --> 45:23.380
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

45:23.380 --> 45:26.820
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

45:26.820 --> 45:30.460
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

45:30.460 --> 45:33.340
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

45:33.340 --> 45:37.420
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

45:37.420 --> 45:40.780
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

45:40.780 --> 45:44.420
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

45:44.420 --> 45:52.220
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪
